# Text fields (selection + clipboard + IME)

Read `docs/TEXT_FIELDS.md` before adding or changing any editable text UI.

**Required for every input:**
- Use `RenameEdit` (not a bare `String` + push/pop)
- Selection visible via `into_element` / `into_element_bare` / masked variant
- Ctrl+A / C / X / V, Shift+Insert; mouse drag-select
- Paste/insert/backspace replace or respect selection
- Chinese IME: if this surface has its own `FocusHandle`, `handle_input` must use **that** handle (see `docs/TERMINAL_IME.md`)

**Do not ship:** KeyDown-only `query.push(ch)` fields without selection (Find bar regression class).

**Known debt (fix when touching):** `PasswordPrompt`, Settings inline shell/font/proxy editors — migrate to `RenameEdit`.
